WEBVTT

00:02:28.168 --> 00:02:30.352
and I would ruin my career.

00:02:30.352 --> 00:02:31.643
And I have to tell you,

00:02:31.643 --> 00:02:34.100
I actually for a moment was a bit afraid.

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:36.170
Then I realized,

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:38.649
the first step to solving any problem

00:02:38.649 --> 00:02:40.440
is to not hide from it,

00:02:40.440 --> 00:02:44.422
and the first step to any form of action

00:02:44.422 --> 00:02:46.477
is awareness.

00:02:46.477 --> 00:02:49.917
And so I decided to actually talk about race.

00:02:49.917 --> 00:02:52.790
And I decided that if I came
here and shared with you

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:54.974
some of my experiences,

00:02:54.974 --> 00:02:57.662
that maybe we could all be a little less anxious

00:02:57.662 --> 00:02:59.208
and a little more bold

00:02:59.208 --> 00:03:02.110
in our conversations about race.